g) |\n| **Build** | B:2602.0.7, OEM: Dell |\n\n---\n\n## \uD83D\uDD0D Root Cause\n\nAfter upgrading from **Azure Local 2512 \u2192 2601**, the upgrade automatically created a new infrastructure LNET (\u0060ceo-clu001-Infra-LNET\u0060) whose IP pool overlaps with an existing customer LNET (\u0060LNET1-Static\u0060).\n\nWhen the customer tries to delete the orphaned NIC (\u0060arcvm001-NIC\u0060) \u2014 left behind after VM deletion \u2014 the webhook validation fires and **rejects the request** because it detects the overlapping IP ranges \u0060[10.10.35.52, 10.10.35.61]\u0060 between the infra LNET and the static LNET.\n\n**Error:**\n\u003E \u0060createupdatevalidationwebhook.infrastructure.azstackhci.microsoft.com denied the request: The following IP Pool ranges you entered are already in use: [10.10.35.52, 10.10.35.61] by ceo-clu001-InfraLNET. Please choose different ranges to avoid conflicts.\u0060\n\n---\n\n## \uD83D\uDCA5 Impact\n\n**Low** \u2014 Internal test stamp in USGov Virginia only. No production customer impact.\n\n---\n\n## \u2705 Recommended Next Steps\n\n1. **Immediate workaround**: Manually delete the orphaned NIC directly via ARM API (bypass the webhook) or use \u0060kubectl\u0060 on the HCI cluster to delete the NIC resource directly.\n2. **LNET conflict resolution**: Adjust the IP pool range of either \u0060LNET1-Static\u0060 or \u0060ceo-clu001-Infra-LNET\u0060 to eliminate the overlap, then retry the NIC deletion.\n3. **Root fix**: The upgrade path from 2512\u21922601 should either (a) detect IP conflicts before creating the infra LNET, or (b) the webhook validation should not block NIC *deletions* due to LNET IP conflicts (only creations/updates need that check).\n4. **Bug filed?**: Check if there\u0027s an existing bug for webhook blocking NIC deletions on LNET conflict \u2014 this seems like a webhook logic error since deleting a NIC should not require validating IP pool uniqueness.","ai.success":true,"ai.model":"claude-sonnet-4.6","ai.durationMs":67375,"ai.inputTokens":130756,"ai.outputTokens":1332},"globalVariables":{"maxQueryScore":0,"body.timestamp":"2026-04-25T00:06:02.838Z","codeIssueFile":"","__webhookBody":"{\n  \u0022incidentId\u0022: 783872773 ,\n  \u0022serviceName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022teamName\u0022: \u0022\u0022,\n  \u0022timestamp\u0022: \u00222026-04-25T00:06:02.838Z\u0022\n}","repoMdFile":"E:\\work\\hub\\docs\\wiki\\repos.md","body.incidentId":783872773,"rcaFile":"","metadataFile":"","body.serviceName":"","discussionFile":"","mitigationStepsFile":"","body.teamName":"","rootRepoFolder":"E:\\work","incidentId":0,"queryLoopCount":0,"applicableTsgFile":"","incidentFolder":"","etwEventsFile":"","summaryFile.md":"","issueListFile":""}}}
